+
+# Matches 16-digit credit card numbers, either without separators or split into
+# four groups of four digits using consistent separators (all spaces or all
+# hyphens). Note that this does not validate the Luhn checksum or card issuer.
+#
+# Examples: "1234567890123456", "1234-5678-9012-3456", "1234 5678 9012 3456"
+credit_card = Regex(r"\d{16}|\d{4}-\d{4}-\d{4}-\d{4}|\d{4} \d{4} \d{4} \d{4}")
